Note on game assets: NMS Galactic Map is a fan-made portal decoder and 3D
galaxy map for No Man's Sky. This license covers the original code
(preview.html, the Netlify Functions, and the address/generation logic) in
this project only. The portal glyphs, race/economy icons, and other imagery
sourced or adapted from No Man's Sky itself are the property of Hello Games
and are not covered by this license -- they're included here under fair-use
fan-project conventions. Anyone reusing this code should credit elegra1965
for the original work and source their own copies of any game assets rather
than relying on this license to cover them.

Note on shared data: this license covers the code only, not any community-
submitted system data collected via the live site's Edit system feature
(stored in data/overrides.json on the deployed backend) -- that data belongs
to the players who submitted it.
